        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-915, Palermo Swirl Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe swirl design of the Palermo Cabinet Cup Pull will add a bit of whimsy to any cabinet door. RK International's Palermo Collection is ornate without seeming dated. The CF-915 Palermo Swirl Cabinet Door Pull is available in 6 finishes including a beautiful polished nickel (pictured) and a stunning valencia bronze.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-palermo-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Palermo Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/swirl-design-palermo-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-115\"><b>Matching Palermo Round Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/rectangle-palermo-collection-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-116\"><b>Matching Palermo Rectangular Cabinet Knob</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-palermo-refrigerator-pull-rk-international-ap-ph-6615\"><b>Matching Palermo Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Palermo Collection CF-915 Cabinet Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
